  "summary": "8 features across HagiCode-org/hagicode-core, HagiCode-org/web.",
  "bodyHtml": "<h2 id=\"features\">Features</h2>\n<h3 id=\"hagicode-orghagicode-core\">HagiCode-org/hagicode-core</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>web:</strong> add DshCli provider configuration and presets (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/d62b6ef42922ba7da1cc382a8dcc3643a09ff923\"><code>d62b6ef</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>orleans:</strong> add DshGrain and executor routing (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/cf11d74d7643fa3ee4d09ea6c6eeef6c64e2ddd5\"><code>cf11d74</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>application:</strong> integrate DshCli into hero app service and monitoring (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/259cc927706c1cd4d9ff438c0ab2d04237e49fc4\"><code>259cc92</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>claudehelper:</strong> add DshCli provider and hero config mapping (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/f80f96f5e922ceca9dcb66b601eb2cc14f4080d9\"><code>f80f96f</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>models:</strong> add DshCli provider type and platform identifiers (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/a57ede0b2e89298467cd7b3b2dc4a84dd54725bf\"><code>a57ede0</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"hagicode-orgweb\">HagiCode-org/web</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>kanban:</strong> add highlight ring to quick AI commit action (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/web/commit/1fd7cd47001102af6e8202c66ef8ea90a71f615c\"><code>1fd7cd4</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>ai-provider:</strong> add DSH AI provider support (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/web/commit/bb37fa2e70ff608c4cd7cfe53b213c124352ac49\"><code>bb37fa2</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>notifications:</strong> cancel all-stopped countdown on delivered notice or mouse move (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/web/commit/fae1dcac1dbf1b98386fa9669d31de69c215bb6a\"><code>fae1dca</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>",
